7product4\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**2\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn904867product4\",\"Garmin f\u0113nix 8\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$999.99\n\n- Excellent multisport and workout tracking\n- Advanced training readiness and recovery metrics\n- Sleep tracking and health monitoring\n- Full golf course maps and golf features\n- Built-in flashlight\n\nBest if fitness, exercise and training are just as important as golf.\n\nAvailable at \ue200url\ue202Best Buy\ue202turn904867product4\ue201\\.\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn945768product17\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"3:4\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn945768product17\",\"Garmin Approach S70\"]\ue201**\n\n# \\$699.99\n\n- Excellent golf GPS\n- Sleep and heart-rate tracking\n- Everyday fitness tracking\n- Up to 16 days of smartwatch battery\n\nBest if you want to save money without sacrificing most of the premium golf experience.\n\nAvailable at \ue200url\ue202Home Depot\ue202turn945768product17\ue201\\.\n\n## Why I'd choose the S72\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"Garmin Approach S72 golf watch on golfer wrist golf course\",\"Garmin Approach S72 AMOLED golf course GPS display\",\"Garmin Approach S72 smartwatch sleep health tracking display\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"5:4\",\"layout\":\"bento\"}\ue201\n\nThe S72 has some particularly interesting upgrades\\:\n\n- **On-course\\:** More than 43,000 golf courses, swing metrics, putting analytics and enhanced golf insights.\n- **During workouts\\:** Strength, mobility, driving range and other activity tracking.\n- **At night\\:** Sleep tracking, sleep insights, heart rate and recovery-related metrics.\n- **Everyday\\:** AMOLED display, built-in flashlight, speaker and microphone.\n\nOne important distinction: the f\u0113nix 8 offers more advanced athletic training analytics, while the S72 puts more emphasis on golf."},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics","o":"add","v":[{"code":"unterminated_tag","action":"recovered_parse","line":68,"column":132}]}]}    

